    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. that's a decent start, it's definitely professional. \n\nthough, looking at the sentiment score for that, it's actually pretty low/neutral. our product manager is kind of pushing us to make these messages feel more \"supportive\" and \"optimistic\" so users don't feel like the app is punishing them. \n\ncan you try another version? try to get that positivity score a bit higher, but again, please don't cross the line into being unprofessional or sounding like a cheerleader. just make it feel a bit more encouraging/warm.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
